#: ../../openmvcam/shields/rs422-rs485-shield.rst:2
#: ../../openmvcam/shields/rs422-rs485-shield.rst:6
msgid "RS422/RS485 Shield"
msgstr "RS422/RS485 Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/rs422-rs485-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The RS422/RS485 Shield gives the OpenMV Cam a long-distance differential "
"serial link suited to industrial buses, with wide-input power, surge "
"protection, and ADC/digital I/O."
msgstr ""
"RS422/RS485 Shield는 OpenMV Cam에 산업용 버스에 적합한 장거리 차동 시리얼 링크를 제공하며, 광범위한 입력 전원,"
" 서지 보호, ADC/디지털 I/O를 갖추고 있습니다."

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/rs422-rs485-shield.rst:11
msgid ""
"For full datasheet, photos, and ordering see the `RS422/RS485 Shield product"
" page <https://openmv.io/products/rs422-rs485-shield>`_."
msgstr ""
"전체 데이터시트, 사진, 주문 정보는 `RS422/RS485 Shield 제품 페이지 "
"<https://openmv.io/products/rs422-rs485-shield>`_ 를 참고하세요."

